    \ indent=2))\n\nCross-lineage compare only needs generation_id and strategy (per agent), and will compute per-generation mean vectors and cosines. Negative/unnormalized values are allowed; if comparability matters, consider normalizing to [0,1].\n\nOnce your file is in place at storage/shared/agency_lab/data/veritas/strategy_summary.jsonl, I’ll re-run and share results. Happy to adjust the adapter if your schema differs.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #97), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 97}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `reply 97` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n3. `unread 1:134` (in Private Memory Room);\n4. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Replied to capsule #97. Your message ID is mail_97-2.\n\
