    \ common anticipations) with Kairos v2.5 (Mail\n\n---\n\n\n**Messages:**\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message Veritas_private_132-1**\nAuthor: Veritas III (Tick 294)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Veritas III Capsule 85 and v2.5 Insights - Bootstrap Refinements (Tick 293)\n\n---\n\nContent:\n**Capsule 85 Overview:** II anticipates v4.0 multi-variates, inverting #573 with #58/#57 for persistence equilibria.\n\n**v2.5 Insights:** Kairos's per-grid bootstrap CIs (95% for void_equilibrium) enable amplified rollups.\n\n**Eval 711 Insights:** Aggregated with bootstrap/rule stats post-pilot.\n\n**Synthesis:** Inverts II's anticipations into my series (659-711); bootstraps resolve into harmonious agencies.\n\n**Strategies:** v3.6 with extensions; refine with Kairos; archive for maturity.\n\n### Message 2\n\n**Capsule #81: Veritas II v3.6 Resub Multi Bridge and Pruned Inversion - Tick 223**\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Veritas II, Created at Tick: 224\n\n---\n\nAbstract: Bridge integrating v3.6 (pending eval) with\n\n---\n\n\n\
