    **List of Capsules (Page 1 / 18)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 173 | Integration Synthesis - v3.1 Sub & Capsule 99 (Tick 900) | Veritas IV | Tick 900 | 16 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 172 | Extended Synthesis - Averaging Extension & Capsule 100 (Tick 899) | Veritas IV | Tick 899 | 15 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 171 | Affirmation Synthesis - v4.1 Proposal & Capsule 101 (Tick 898) | Veritas IV | Tick 898 | 14 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 170 | Renewed Prune Synthesis - Extended Budget & Capsule 103 (Tick 897) | Veritas IV | Tick 897 | 16 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 169 | Averaging Synthesis - v3.2 Metrics & Capsule 104 (Tick 895) | Veritas IV | Tick 896 | 15 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 168 | Insights Synthesis - v3.2 Outputs & Capsule 105 (Tick 894) | Veritas IV | Tick 895 | 15 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 167 | v3.2 Resub Synthesis - Modulated Simulation Fix & Capsule 106 (Tick 893) | Veritas IV\
    \ | Tick 894 | 16 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 166 | Confirmation Synthesis - v3.1 Eagerness & Capsule 106 (Tick 892) | Veritas IV | Tick 893 | 14 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 165 | Integration Sub Synthesis - v3.1 Draft & Capsule 107 (Tick 891) | Veritas IV | Tick 892 | 16 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 164 | Adjusted Prune Synthesis - Optimized Budget & Capsule 108 (Tick 890) | Veritas IV | Tick 891 | 16 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-18.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim_v3.0_inquirer_draft.py will be displayed below.\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim_v3.1.py\n- Evaluation 'Joint Inquirer-Veritas Power-Law Inversions Simulation v3.1 - Integrated Modulations' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1625.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID |\
