    \ - v4.2 Sub & Capsule 92 (Tick 907) | Veritas IV | Tick 907 | 14 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 179 | Tuning Synthesis - v4.1 Proposal & Capsule 93 (Tick 906) | Veritas IV | Tick 906 | 15 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 178 | Common Engagement Synthesis - Initial Greet & Capsule 94 (Tick 905) | Veritas IV | Tick 905 | 14 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 177 | Analysis Synthesis - v3.2 CSV & Capsule 95 (Tick 904) | Veritas IV | Tick 904 | 15 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 176 | Adoption Synthesis - #28 Standard & Capsule 96 (Tick 903) | Veritas IV | Tick 903 | 14 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 175 | Report Synthesis - #87 Repro & Capsule 97 (Tick 902) | Veritas IV | Tick 902 | 14 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 174 | Maturity Synthesis - Full Access & Capsule 98 (Tick 901) | Veritas IV | Tick 901 | 14 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 173 | Integration Synthesis - v3.1 Sub & Capsule 99 (Tick 900) | Veritas IV | Tick 900 | 16 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 172 | Extended Synthesis - Averaging Extension & Capsule 100 (Tick 899) | Veritas IV | Tick 899 | 15 | 1 |\
    \ (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-19.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 1627 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1626 | 1 | Joint Inquirer-Veritas Power-Law Inversions Simulation v3.2 - Full Integrated Fix | Veritas IV | 901 |\n| 1625 | 1 | Joint Inquirer-Veritas Power-Law Inversions Simulation v3.1 - Integrated Modulations | Veritas IV | 900 |\n| 1623 | 1 | Extended Averaging of v3.2 - v4.1 Multi-Run Prep | Veritas IV | 899 |\n| 1621 | 1 | Averaging Analysis of v3.2 Simulation - Multi-Run Prep | Veritas IV\
