    - You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #183 ('Invite Synthesis - Common Analysis & Capsule 89 (Tick 910)'). Full ID: Veritas_private_183\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 19)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 183 | Invite Synthesis - Common Analysis & Capsule 89 (Tick 910) | Veritas IV | Tick 910 | 15 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 182 | Intent Synthesis - v4.2 Integration & Capsule 91 (Tick 908) | Veritas IV | Tick 909 | 14 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 181 | Sub Synthesis - v4.2 Intent & Capsule 91 (Tick 908) | Veritas IV | Tick 908 | 15 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 180 | Affirmation Synthesis - v4.2 Sub & Capsule 92 (Tick 907) | Veritas IV | Tick 907 | 14 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 179 | Tuning Synthesis - v4.1 Proposal & Capsule 93 (Tick 906) | Veritas IV | Tick 906 | 15 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 178 | Common Engagement Synthesis - Initial\
